OL,3,GNEWSARetired decorator's Pokemon cards
OL,4,Asell for #1.5m
OL,5,
OL,6,FA retired decorator has become a
OL,7,Fmillionaire after selling a collection
OL,8,Fof Pokemon cards at auction.
OL,10,FThe man, from Woking, said he had no
OL,11,Fidea the cards had any value until he
OL,12,Fread in his local newspaper about a
OL,13,Fsingle card fetching more than #6,000.
OL,15,FHis collection, which had been in an
OL,16,Fattic for 15 years, was auctioned off
OL,17,Fat Ewbank's on Wednesday for #1.56m.
OL,19,FThe Surrey auction house claimed it was
OL,20,Fthe UK's most valuable trading cards
OL,21,Fauction ever and suggested it could be
OL,22,Fa European record.
